*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Countess Koryessa]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**1 [[Elder Sloth]] spawns.
**2 [[Ursamajor]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Dark enemies can be controlled and killed by [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Ranger]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] respectively. Bring [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] and use Lady Skory as a platform to allow [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] to snipe the backliners. Once it's just the Aliens, you'll want either rushers or backliners to sneak in hits on the Ursamajor; [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]]/[[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]] work phenomenally in that role.

